Full ruleset (Persian, authoritative): `docs/security-rules.md`. Read it before touching PHP/JS.

**Golden rule: Validate -> Sanitize (input) -> Prepare (query) -> Escape (output).** Code missing a layer is incomplete.

Baseline: PHP 8.1, WordPress 6.8. Code in `plugin-template/src/` (PSR-4, `HowToWP\PluginTemplate\`), prefix `htw_pt_` / `HTW_PT_` / `htw-pt-`, text domain = slug.

Non-negotiable:
1. Never use `$_POST/$_GET/$_REQUEST/$_SERVER/$_COOKIE` raw: `isset` -> `wp_unslash` -> sanitize -> validate. Whitelist (`in_array(..., true)`) for fixed choices.
2. Escape every output late (`esc_html`, `esc_attr`, `esc_url`, `esc_textarea`, `wp_kses_post`, `esc_html__`); literal strings only in `__()` / `_e()`.
3. Every query with variable input goes through `$wpdb->prepare()` (`%d %f %s`, `esc_like()` for LIKE); table/column names from whitelists. Prefer WP APIs.
4. Every PHP file starts with `defined( 'ABSPATH' ) || exit;` (`uninstall.php`: `defined( 'WP_UNINSTALL_PLUGIN' ) || exit;`).
5. Every state-changing action (form, AJAX, REST, link) checks **nonce AND capability** (never only `is_admin()`).
6. No `die` / `exit` / `wp_die` in normal flow. `exit` only: ABSPATH guard, WP_UNINSTALL_PLUGIN guard, right after `wp_safe_redirect()`, after `wp_send_json_*`, after streaming a file download. Errors -> `WP_Error`.
7. Every REST route and every Ability has a real `permission_callback`; write/delete is never wide open.

Also: assets only via `wp_enqueue_*` (version = plugin constant, load only on own screens); pass data to JS with `wp_add_inline_script` or `wp_interactivity_state`, NOT `wp_localize_script`; HTTP via `wp_remote_*`; files via `WP_Filesystem` / `wp_handle_upload`, sanitized paths; tabs, Yoda, docblocks, lines <= 120 (aim ~100); `index.php` ("Silence is golden") in the plugin root and every subfolder (`build/` gets it from the npm `postbuild` script); `error_log()` not `var_dump`; no secrets in code; AI only via core AI Client, feature-detected, no API keys.

Fix priority: (1) security blockers (SQLi, XSS, nonce/capability, ABSPATH), (2) release standards (enqueue, readme.txt/index.php, i18n), (3) quality (die/exit, error handling, line length, WPCS). Fix root causes everywhere the pattern repeats.

Before finishing: `composer lint && composer phpcs && composer phpstan && composer test` and `npm run build` inside `plugin-template/`. Definition of Done: `AGENTS.md`.
